    note left of SharedMemoryFactory
        The lifetime of the MappedRegionFactory is tied to the lifetime of the SharedMemoryFactory. The 
        SharedMemoryFactory owns the MappedRegionFactory exclusively. If an application needs to use 
        a MappedRegionFactory directly elsewhere in the process, it should create another instance. See
        the note on the MappedRegionFactory for more details.
    end note

