    note top of SharedMemoryResourceRegistry
        SharedMemoryResourceRegistrySingleton is always the entry point for accessing 
        the memory resource registry. In production code, all functions in the 
        SharedMemoryResourceRegistrySingleton will dispatch to SharedMemoryResourceRegistry.
        For testing, InjectMock can be used to inject a mock ISharedMemoryResourceRegistry.
